        a 5 V lead whose two contacts are at 0 stays at or under 10 A only while the other VH contacts are at or under 3.24 mOhm
      JST's own limit is 10 mOhm initial and 20 mOhm after test: a harness INSIDE its maker's limits can put more than its printed
      rating through a ribbon conductor or a lead contact. The design holds only while the VH contacts are better than their maker's printed limit.
